===Etymology===
{{af|ru|де́ва|-ка}}. Compare {{cog|cs|děvka}} — {{m|cs|dívka}}, {{cog|pl|dziwka}} — {{m|pl|dziewka}} distinction.

Compare typologically {{m+|cs|nevěstka}} (< {{m|cs|nevěsta}} + {{m|cs|-ka}}, whence also {{m|cs|nevěstinec}}, a natively formed term for “brothel”).

